          "The classification expected is **ARIA**: **intermittent** (under 4 days a week or under 4 consecutive weeks) versus **persistent** (4 or more days a week and over 4 weeks), and **mild** (sleep, daily activity, sport, school and work normal) versus **moderate-severe** (any one impaired) - duration picks the regimen, severity picks the step. [ARIA 2020]",
